==================== Input ====================
// The content gate: no `openapi` member at the root.
//
// Every key here is a table name and every object would be reordered if the gate were open, which is
// the point. `"swagger": "2.0"` deliberately does not match -- the root table is 3.x-shaped.
//
// Layout still normalises, as it does for any file a formatter touches; what must not change is the
// key order. That the whole output is identical with the option off is asserted directly by
// `non_openapi_documents_are_untouched` in `tests/fixtures/mod.rs`.
{
  "swagger": "2.0",
  "paths": {
    "/p": {
      "get": {
        "responses": { "200": { "content": {}, "description": "ok" } },
        "summary": "s",
        "operationId": "op"
      }
    }
  },
  "components": { "schemas": { "Pet": { "type": "object", "description": "A pet" } } }
}

